    "turn_text": "do you do you get to work across the aisle much than outside of appropriations or I mean again you've you've been in the fourth district for 20 some years now you have a little bit more I mean I was joking to someone, the producer said, well, if he's too late, you'll just run against him and I said, there's no chance in hell, because he's an institution in the triangle. There's no one who could beat David Fries now. But you have that luxury of being able to have the seniority that you have. But do you get to do too much with the other side, or is it really a almost parliamentary whipped",
