    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "Why do you think we don't hear? Why do you think the public doesn't hear so much about that? I mean, obviously the news wants to fixate on things that are a little bit more juicy and controversial. But the general sense from the American public, I think, is that Congress is just a cesspit of people fighting and not getting anything productive done. Why do we not hear more about things like this or bipartisan solutions to the budget or immigration? Why do we not get to hear any of the good",
