    "turn_text": "The conflict is real and the conflict is more severe and so there's of course truth in that. in that portrayal, but I'm saying it's not the whole picture and it's a good question why we don't hear more about the other side. I think the press is drawn to conflict. They love covering campaigns. They give a big yawn when it comes to covering the day-to-day work of the Congress. And so it's our job, of course, to make it more interesting and exciting and dramatic. We try in various ways to do that",
