    "turn_text": "No one would ever say that. No. And, you know, I'm not the most exciting feature on the evening news. I'm aware that I have certain, certain talents, and that's not one of them. But I do think the answer to your question is yes. I mean, there are different roles that people respect and it may not be quite as simple as just work horses and show horses, but there are different styles, there are different areas that we specialize in. And the place is still You know flexible enough fluid enough where you can you can get some satisfaction doing something like Initiating a a body to work with the part of its inner internationally or or or You know in my case I'm now on appropriations and I get a lot of my satisfaction from from boosting things that I believe in, you know, within the housing and transportation areas. I mean, that really is obscure in terms of people's knowing about it. But when North Carolina gets up, a major grant that's going to let us sooner rather than later of institute train service from Raleigh to Richmond and make this southeast quarter.",
