    "turn_idx": 48,
    "turn_text": "But do those who are on camera ever? I mean, the last thing I want you to do is try to say something bad about anyone specifically. But do those who are on camera from either party? do more to hurt the actual progress and work that either you or perhaps Speaker Pelosi is trying to push through by. I'm going to use a name you don't have to, but I think about people like AOC or Rashida Talib or some of the very outspoken folks who focus on certain issues that may not be the priority for the speaker at the moment. Do some of those show, I'm not going to use the word because you don't like it, but do some of those more vocal, congressmen and women, ever get it in the way. And how does the party, how does the leadership reel them in when necessary?",
