    "turn_text": "Now, I want to take a minute to tell you about an awesome and delicious service that's really perfect, especially for the times we're in right now. It's HelloFresh, and you've heard about HelloFresh probably, but you really need to take another look. at HelloFresh and how great it is. With HelloFresh, you totally get fresh pre-measured ingredients and incredible, blah, blah, blah, blah. Incredible recipes. I do know how to speak. I don't know how to cook though. So HelloFresh is sort of perfect for me because you get all the ingredients and they're already measured. Like that's always my biggest problem when it comes to cooking, knowing how to measure the right amount of all these ingredients and make sure it all gets in the right place. How in fresh does all that work for you? And it also lets you skip the trips to the grocery store and it's totally easy and it's fun and it's affordable and it's actually now I believe America's number one meal kit. It is the OG. It is the goat, the greatest of all time when it comes to meal kits. They have A whole bunch of recipes, dozens of recipes and they've got a range of flavors and it's not just different flavors, it's different cuisines and whole bunch of ingredients and you won't get bored. There's always something new to try every single week. You've always got a new recipe to do and it's totally convenient and it's never been healthier, never been easier. You can actually get low cow meals, you can get carbs, smart meals, vegetarian meals. fish, lover, I think that's pescetarian meal options. They've got those every week. So if you're vegetarian, you're never going to have to just sit around and wait until they have a veggie option. They've got that every week. And no matter what you choose, every single one of them comes totally packed with fresh produce. It's sourced directly from farmers and you can be flexible with it. You can customize the weeks you need it. You can add in extra proteins, extra sides, change up the serving size. If you got guests coming over, if you want to do a dinner party and look like you are real fancy and know what you're doing or you just want to double up on the favorite recipes because they're really good and you want extra helpings next time. You can make your box work for you every week and you can easily change your delivery days or your food preferences. You can skip a week. I've done some of these meal delivery services. They screw you over because you got to subscribe and you can't skip weeks and then you're going to be out of time. Hello, Fresh. You can skip weeks. And they're quick. They're healthy. It's 10, 20 minutes. You can feed your whole family in minutes. We're always pressed for time at my house. These meals are perfect when you're pressed for time. Go to HelloFresh.com slash one zero heck and use the code one zero heck for 10 meals. So it's HelloFresh.com slash. 10 heck and use the code 10 heck one zero heck for 10 free meals, 10 free meals, including free shipping. That's hellofresh.com slash one zero heck and use the code one zero heck for 10 free meals, including free shipping. It's America's number one meal kit. One more time, go to hellofresh.com slash 10 heck and use the code 10 heck. That's all one word for 10 free meals, including free shipping or look for the link in our show notes. Y'all had a call that kind of got leaked right at the beginning of the year a little bit. I remember Abigail Spahnberger having some choice quotes that came out of that caucus call about the differing opinions within the Democrat Party on how to win the Corey Bush successes and the Jamal Bowman success versus the how difficult it was for Abigail Spineberger or Connor Lamb to win their districts. Where do you actually kind of have a very, a little interesting scenario here in the triangle being that it's your district's pretty, pretty progressive with Chapel Hill and parts of Raleigh. Where do you fall on that? Because again, you're in a place where you you're safe and loved and you don't have much to worry about when it comes to re-election. But you're also one of the only members of Congress in the South, Democrats in the South right now who, you know, pieces of your district have over the years fallen into some of these more suburban areas. So the Abigail Spannberger versus Corey Bush argument Where do you think the Democrat party needs to do to make sure that it doesn't split just like the Republicans look like they're doing?",
