    "turn_text": "I think we could pass a law tomorrow if we had the political will to do it. I certainly would vote for it. We have a comprehensive reform proposal that we call HR1 because it's the, we gave it primacy when we took leadership two years ago. And it includes non-partisan redistricting commissions for every state. And that's, I think that's an idea whose time has come.",
